{"author":["Elastic"],"description":"检测Windows首次加载驱动。对应需求：权限提升。官方：First Time Seen Driver Loaded。","from":"now-9m","index":["logs-endpoint.events.library-*"],"language":"kuery","license":"Elastic License v2","name":"【默认】Windows首次加载驱动","note":"## 调查指引\n\n### 规则说明\nWindows首次加载驱动\n\n### 为何重要\n获取更高权限\n\n### 调查步骤\n1. 核对告警实体、进程/网络字段与时间窗。\n2. 核对是否符合变更窗口与已知业务工具。\n3. 关联同主机或同账号前后同类告警。\n\n### 常见误报\n- 合法变更窗口内的运维、发布或安全扫描\n\n### 响应建议\n1. 确认是否授权与变更窗口。\n2. 无授权则隔离相关主机或账号并排查落地与外连。\n3. 按主机与用户关联前后同类告警。\n","setup":"## 设置说明\n\n1. 目标 Windows 主机安装 Elastic Agent，启用 **Elastic Defend**（按规则需要进程/网络/文件/注册表或安全日志）。\n2. 确认相关数据流有数据后再评估告警。\n","references":["https://www.elastic.co/kr/security-labs/stopping-vulnerable-driver-attacks"],"risk_score":47,"rule_id":"df0fd41e-5590-4965-ad5e-cd079ec22fa9","severity":"medium","tags":["操作系统: Windows","主题: 权限提升","来源: 默认","对应需求: 权限提升"],"timestamp_override":"event.ingested","type":"new_terms","query":"event.category:\"driver\" and host.os.type:windows and event.action:\"load\"\n","threat":[{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1068","name":"Exploitation for Privilege Escalation","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1068/"},{"id":"T1547","name":"Boot or Logon Autostart Execution","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1547/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1547.006","name":"Kernel Modules and Extensions","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1547/006/"}]}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0004","name":"Privilege Escalation","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0004/"}},{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1543","name":"Create or Modify System Process","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1543/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1543.003","name":"Windows Service","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1543/003/"}]}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0003","name":"Persistence","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0003/"}}],"new_terms_fields":["dll.pe.original_file_name","dll.code_signature.subject_name"],"history